OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1787082490
OL,3,CBody found in search for missing
OL,4,CNorthumberland man Liam Potts
OL,6,FA body has been found in the search
OL,7,Ffor a missing 22-year-old man in
OL,8,FNorthumberland.
OL,10,FPolice confirmed on Tuesday (18
OL,11,FAugust) that a body had been recovered
OL,12,Ffrom the River Tyne at Wylam in the
OL,13,Fsearch for Liam Potts and his family
OL,14,Fhave been informed.
OL,16,FIn a statement, Northumbria Police
OL,17,Fsaid: "This is an extremely sad
OL,18,Fdevelopment, and our thoughts are very
OL,19,Fmuch with Liam's family and friends.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/3
