OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1787082490
OL,3,CBody found in search for missing
OL,4,CNorthumberland man Liam Potts
OL,6,F"I would like to thank all of our
OL,7,Fofficers, partners and volunteers for
OL,8,Ftheir assistance throughout the
OL,9,Fsearches, along with everyone who
OL,10,Fshared our appeals and contacted us
OL,11,Fwith information.
OL,13,F"We would continue to ask that people
OL,14,Frespect the family's privacy at this
OL,15,Ftragic time."
OL,17,FMr Potts was last seen on Saturday (15
OL,18,FAugust) morning shortly after
OL,19,Fmidnight. Concerns were raised when he
OL,20,Fdid not returned home following a
OL,21,Fnight out with friends.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/3
