PN,39203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1787082490
OL,3,CBody found in search for missing
OL,4,CNorthumberland man Liam Potts
OL,6,FPolice do not believe there is any
OL,7,Fthird-party involvement.
OL,9,FSearches for Mr Potts were carried out
OL,10,Fby Northumbria Police and a range of
OL,11,Fpartners, including HM Coastguard,
OL,12,FNorth of Tyne Mountain and
OL,13,FNorthumberland National Park Mountain
OL,14,FRescue teams.
OL,16,FMr Potts was an active member of the
OL,17,FColdstream Guards and played a role in
OL,18,Fthe funeral procession of Queen
OL,19,FElizabeth II and the coronation of
OL,20,FKing Charles III.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/3
